":6421,"name":"Crunchyroll"},{"animation":false,"id":144,"name":"Pony Canyon"},{"animation":false,"id":513,"name":"Nikkatsu"},{"animation":false,"id":6677,"name":"MAGNET"},{"animation":false,"id":6616,"name":"BS11"},{"animation":false,"id":6572,"name":"APDREAM"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Dead of overwork at age 27...\n\nMidori barely had time to lament having to die that way when a god appeared before her and said, \"You will reincarnate in another world and tell me whether you think humans deserve to continue existing there. In return, I will grant you a special power.\" Then Midori, hoping to relieve the exhaustion of the harsh life she'd lived, found herself asking... to cuddle cute, fluffy animals.\n\nThus Midori reincarnated in her new world as a young girl named Nefertima, with a power that causes her to be loved by all living things other than humans. That includes not only animals, but holy beasts like white tigers and dragons, and even monsters like goblins and frozen spiders! But there was also a cruel fate awaiting her...\n\nNefertima is determined to do her best to coexist with humans and all living creatures in her new life of petting and patting cute animals!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\nNote: Each episode streamed 1 week early on ABEMA. The original TV broadcast started on January 7th, 2024."},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reincarnation","rank":77,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Magic","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Iyashikei","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Goblin","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Class Struggle","rank":60,"spoiler":fal